@Projetos___4_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014
@nome = Fabio
@email = artur@teste1.com
@senha = SenhaForte123!


POST {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/User/auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "{{nome}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{senha}}",
  "typeofUser": 0
}

### 2. Login: execute antes das chamadas que precisam do token.

# @name login
POST {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/User/auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{senha}}"
}

###
GET {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/User/Artur/Details
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/User/Artur/Details
Accept: application/json

### 5. Criar host: campos do HostRegisterDTO; exige token válido.
POST {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/Host/Create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
{
  "typeofhost": 1,
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "instagranUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/host_teste",
  "address": "Rua de Teste, 100",
  "neighborhood": "Centro",
  "cep": "01001-000",
  "phone": "(11) 99999-0000",
  "name": "Host de Teste",
  "description": "Estabelecimento de teste da API."
}

### Read: exige token com role HOST. Faça login novamente após receber a role.
POST {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/Host/Read
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 6. Excluir o próprio usuário: execute somente quando terminar os testes.
DELETE {{Projetos___4_HostAddress}}/api/User
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "{{nome}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{senha}}",
  "typeofUser": 0
}
